    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is the story content of this game?</strong></h2>This is a fictional story in which you will embark on a thrilling escape experience with a man named KunKun.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is the gameplay of this game\uff1f</strong></h2>This is a first person horror game with both horror and comedy elements. In the game, you need to avoid Kunkun's pursuit and find a way to escape through various decryptions!<br>When you were found,you can evade KunKun Kun's pursuit by hiding in a specific cabinet\uff01<br>The game contains several hidden exploration elements, and some of which can affect the ending.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How many endings does this game include?</strong></h2>This game includes 3 endings that are triggered by achieving specific conditions.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The screenshot of the game is as follows\uff1a</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642890/extras/34592731292344058b7046950d6ea1a5.avif?t=1699704187\" width=624 height=388 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642890/extras/9c4bde14f165787af861e82e36a15085.avif?t=1699704187\" width=800 height=454 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642890/extras/ff6fd9b89b180dd239f57c68f8c70826.avif?t=1699704187\" width=690 height=474 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2642890/extras/bd182fa5e752e7b1dd094c0d48d11862.avif?t=1699704187\" width=526 height=384 /></span><br><br>All content in the game is unrelated to reality, and any similarity is purely coincidental.<br>The game contains scare elements. If you lack courage, please exit in a ti